  "repo_truth": "Discovery cycle p3b-cli-surface-proof-implementation-discovery-1 returned P2 p3b-final-implementation-review-P2-1 because both rich M4 objectives omitted the architect directive's credible alternative and trade-off, plus P4 p3b-final-implementation-review-P4-1 because the proof said two discovery findings while listing three. Parent remediation changes only both canonical M4 objective strings, their two deterministic views, the downstream plan, the M5 selector record, one focused semantic assertion inside the existing feature_spec_contract test, and slice-local proof/todo records. The objective now states the selected staged canonical-YAML approach, a Markdown-authority alternative, and its manual-editing versus validation/identity/provenance trade-off. Post-remediation focused semantic/M4/M5 tests pass, the complete 273-test packet wall passes, cargo test --workspace --quiet exits 0 after 717 seconds with two platform-marked ignores, strict clippy/fmt/archive/diff checks pass, four transient generated outputs remain absent, and the eight unrelated paths remain outside the 48-file subject.",
  "allowed_scope": [
    "Replay all 48 manifest hashes and compare the changed post-remediation subject with discovery fingerprint sha256:d09980fd22af6ec255196a1d0d1452609c8d0aff7fd61745d080efe0e19c3491.",
    "Review only the known P2 remediation, directly affected canonical input/view/planning/semantic-test paths, proof-count correction, selector/proof truth, and any remediation-caused regression.",
    "Confirm the objective contains an explicit proposed approach, credible alternative, and concrete trade-off in both canonical inputs and all dependent selected outputs.",
    "Verify focused semantic/M4/M5, full packet, workspace, lint, archive, diff, transient-output, and scope proof as needed.",
    "Confirm no production/runtime, released definition/schema, public API, Cargo/dependency, sibling seam, classification, or proof-level change occurred."
  ],
  "non_goals": [
    "No open-ended discovery outside the known remediation and its directly affected contract/call/proof paths.",
    "No edits, formatting, staging, commit, push, handoff, ledger, dispatch, or delegation.",
    "No P1A, P1B, P1C, P2, P4, P5, P6, P7, sibling-slice, production/runtime, schema/definition, public API, dependency, Cargo/version, unsafe-policy, release, or migration work.",
    "Do not reopen clean unchanged selector decisions or unrelated advisories."
  ],
  "tasks": [
    "Verify complete post-remediation subject identity and exact delta from the discovery fingerprint.",
    "Confirm p3b-final-implementation-review-P2-1 is closed by directive-compliant objectives and an effective semantic assertion.",
    "Confirm the two canonical YAML inputs, two deterministic views, downstream plan, and selector record remain mutually coherent.",
    "Confirm p3b-final-implementation-review-P4-1 is corrected and the proof reports final commands truthfully.",
    "Check directly affected real paths and proof for remediation-caused P1/P2 regression.",
    "Return findings first in Critical, Required, Optional, Nit order with severity, exact file/line, violated gate, why wrong, smallest remediation, and missing verification."
  ],
  "contracts_and_gates": [
    "The Work Specification objective must state the selected approach, at least one credible alternative, and trade-offs without adding schema fields",
    "Canonical Stage 10 YAML remains authoritative and the Markdown view remains deterministic/non-authoritative",
    "Happy and skip canonical inputs/views remain pairwise byte-identical and feature identity remains fs-m4-foundation-journey-2026-04",
    "M5 repo and bundle consumers produce the same plan from canonical YAML",
    "No production symbol, released schema/definition, public API, Cargo/dependency, sibling seam, classification, or proof-level change is permitted",
    "No unresolved valid P1/P2 may remain before commit"
  ],
  "stop_conditions": [
    "Return blocked if complete subject identity, discovery delta, or required read-only evidence cannot be established.",
    "Report rather than repair any finding.",
    "Do not edit, delegate, create another dispatch, write a handoff, modify the ledger, stage, commit, or push."
  ],
